			"Message": "feat(Grove): Implement language provider registration system\n\nAdd ProviderStore with atomic handle allocation to track active language provider registrations in the VS Code API facade. Each register_*_provider method now:\n1. Generates a unique handle from the atomic counter\n2. Stores the (provider_type, selector) tuple in the ProviderStore\n3. Returns a Disposable that removes the registration when dispose() is called\n\nRefactor Disposable to support callback invocation: previously a unit struct, now holds an optional FnOnce that executes on dispose(). This enables proper lifecycle management where extensions can clean up registrations.\n\nAll 18 register_*_provider methods and set_language_configuration now perform actual registration instead of returning no-op Disposables. Added active_registration_count() for debugging.\n\nNote: Mountain gRPC forwarding (P4 task) will be added in Grove-Vine Connection to forward registrations to Mountain's CocoonService.",
			"SHA": "dfa6dad4d38756df79b309d732e47db57fab0b8e"
